    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "54C29DBBFD75281A",
      "text": "¡Le traigo la cartera!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "54C29CBBFD752667",
      "text": "Se ha olvidado una cosa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_system_01",
      "hash64": "C22350BAFFC104CD",
      "text": "Le has entregado al Líder de Gimnasio la cartera\\nque se había olvidado.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "930AF7305CF0C4B9",
      "text": "¡Cachis la mar! ¡Si es mi cartera![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "930AF8305CF0C66C",
      "text": "¿Cómo dices? ¿Que la recepcionista te ha\\nenviado a entregármela?[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "930AF9305CF0C81F",
      "text": "¡Fua, ja, ja! ¡Esa moza me ha salvado la vida!\\n¡Gracias a l[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oas dos![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "930AFA305CF0C9D2",
      "text": "Por cierto, perdona al besugo de mi aprendiz por\\nsu falta de modales.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "gym_mizu_020_mizu_07",
      "hash64": "930AFB305CF0CB85",
      "text": "Hemos venido a la famosísima [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]subasta[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] de Pueblo\\nMarinada porque sabemos que tienen un artículo\\r\\nque queremos sí o sí.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
